---
// The chapter's key sentence: the one idea to remember, the largest text in the chapter body (h3 size,
// Regular, ink), before the supporting paragraphs. Usually the first element of a <Chapter>.
//   <Key>The problem was never motivation: it was the effort between intention and plate.</Key>
---

<p class="key" data-reveal><slot /></p>

<style>
  .key {
    max-width: calc((200% - var(--gutter)) / 3);
    font-size: var(--fs-h3);
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.22;
    letter-spacing: -0.022em;
    color: var(--ink);
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .key {
      max-width: none;
    }
  }
</style>
